OL,3,GNEWSASandie Peggie loses discrimination
OL,4,Acase against nursing union
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nurse has failed in her claim of
OL,7,Fdiscrimination against a union about
OL,8,Fher beliefs on biological sex and
OL,9,Fgender.
OL,11,FSandie Peggie alleged the Royal College
OL,12,Fof Nursing (RCN) had failed to
OL,13,Fadequately support her during a dispute
OL,14,Fwith NHS Fife and Dr Beth Upton.
OL,16,FThe RCN disputed the claim, arguing
OL,17,Fthat it had acted "reasonably"
OL,18,Fthroughout the process.
