OL,3,GNEWSASandie Peggie loses discrimination
OL,4,Acase against nursing union
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is the second employment tribunal
OL,7,Fbrought by Peggie over the dispute with
OL,8,FDr Upton, a transgender woman - that is
OL,9,Fa biological male who identifies as a
OL,10,Fwoman.
